#. module: l10n_ca_payroll
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_payroll.field_hr_contract__l10n_ca_rpp_amount
msgid ""
"Employee contribution to a registered pension plan withheld from each pay by"
" salary rule CA_RPP, with the RPP input of the payslip. It lowers the "
"taxable income of the pay (F of the CRA and Revenu Quebec formulas) and is "
